      "difficulty": 2,
      "distractors": ["u89-i07", "u81-i09"],
      "note": "Same ల్ల vattu as ఇల్లు (house) from your very first unit — you've been reading vattulu since day one."
    },
    {
      "id": "u89-i06",
      "te": "అత్త",
