      "tags": ["word"],
      "difficulty": 3,
      "distractors": ["u89-i11", "u89-i12"],
      "note": "The ర vattu is a little hook slung beside the letter. ప్రేమ, ప్రశ్న, ప్రయాణం — pr- words are everywhere."
